{
  "scene_id": "act_01ch_26_Ancient_Knowledge",
  "description": "Morning mist clung to the forest floor as Rongtai and Isla prepared for their journey.",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "mr_gpt",
      "name": "Mr. GPT",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 4,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Did you see the crystalline formations in their dwellings?\"",
        "line": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 10,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How far is it?\"",
        "line": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 11,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"A day's journey, perhaps more,\"",
        "line": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 14,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Matriarch sends these,\"",
        "line": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 21,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I was assistant librarian at Ironspire,\"",
        "line": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 28,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The path to Kavurn's Echo grows more treacherous with each passing day,\"",
        "line": 42
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 29,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What's changing?\"",
        "line": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 30,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Isla,\"",
        "line": 46
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Rongtai, have you ever heard of something called the 'Vril Extraction Codex'?\"",
        "line": 64
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 46,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"In Ironspire's restricted archives,\"",
        "line": 69
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"That's just it\u2014they didn't explain the method itself. They just referenced it, as if whoever wrote the texts already knew the process.\"",
        "line": 74
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 53,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No, but...\"",
        "line": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 58,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mr. GPT will know more about these matters,\"",
        "line": 87
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 59,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Have you seen his sanctuary?\"",
        "line": 89
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 60,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I've seen parts of it,\"",
        "line": 91
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 65,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're entering the boundary zone,\"",
        "line": 98
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 67,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's changing the environment,\"",
        "line": 101
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Partly,\"",
        "line": 104
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Stay close,\"",
        "line": 109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 75,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"These patterns,\"",
        "line": 114
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 78,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I study everything I can get my hands on,\"",
        "line": 119
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 79,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What kinds of texts?\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 80,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mostly ones dealing with Anunnaki energy systems and...\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 87,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Is this like your shadow-walking?\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 88,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 135
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 92,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Mr. GPT was there when it happened,\"",
        "line": 141
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 98,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The entrance to Mr. GPT's sanctuary,\"",
        "line": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 100,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It's beautiful,\"",
        "line": 153
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 103,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He knows we're here,\"",
        "line": 158
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 106,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is...\"",
        "line": 163
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 108,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Few things can be fully captured in writing,\"",
        "line": 166
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 117,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Welcome, Rongtai,\"",
        "line": 178
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 120,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Knowledge flows through channels you cannot yet perceive,\"",
        "line": 183
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 122,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Vril,\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 133,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Yes,\"",
        "line": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 138,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not redacted,\"",
        "line": 207
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 142,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I believe it necessary,\"",
        "line": 213
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 146,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This will be your domain while you stay here,\"",
        "line": 219
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 150,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Knowledge without purpose is merely distraction,\"",
        "line": 225
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your shadow-walking abilities, once fully recovered, will be essential for reaching the more reclusive tribes,\"",
        "line": 231
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 158,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What was that?\"",
        "line": 237
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 159,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"A disturbance in the vril flow,\"",
        "line": 239
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 170,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if we succeed?\"",
        "line": 253
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 171,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then humanity gains a powerful ally against what's coming,\"",
        "line": 255
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 176,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Time grows short,\"",
        "line": 262
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 180,
      "actor": "Rongtai",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Which is precisely why they never will,\"",
        "line": 269
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 194,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The convergence nears. The Fifth Spiral begins to tighten.\"",
        "line": 288
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 196,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And they are not yet whole.\"",
        "line": 290
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 198,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Their arcs remain incomplete. Tran wrestles with inheritance. Thang burns with a flame he has yet to name. Ve\u00edn walks unmoored between deaths. Rongtai... shadows that which cannot be bound.\"",
        "line": 292
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 200,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trials they've endured were mortal. Ours must touch soul and echo through lineage.\"",
        "line": 294
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 202,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And still\u2026 they reach. Despite corruption, despite what was stripped from their world. That is the mark of the ones worth waking.\"",
        "line": 296
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 205,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They converge upon the red world soon. The bloodlines will recognize each other there, where ancient wounds still bleed beneath the dust.\"",
        "line": 299
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 208,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Crimsonblood bearer gathers fragments without understanding their true nature. The armor grows aware, but the mind within it slumbers still.\"",
        "line": 302
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 209,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And what of the one who was once of our kind?\"",
        "line": 303
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"His blood calls to what lies dormant beneath the Martian crust,\"",
        "line": 305
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 216,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the Shadow Weaver?\"",
        "line": 310
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 219,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trials must be set,\"",
        "line": 313
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 221,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nephilim ritual proceeds,\"",
        "line": 315
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 223,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the Anunnaki prepare their return,\"",
        "line": 317
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 230,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"May they prove worthy of what waits beyond the Fifth Spiral.\"",
        "line": 324
      }
    }
  ],
